    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11655" root="خنى" body-key="x">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنِىَ</span></b>  (S, K) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْهِ</span> (S) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى مَنْطِقِهِ</span> (TA,) aor.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخْنَى</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنًى</span>; (TA;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنَا</span>, (JK,
K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخْنُو</span>, (JK, TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنْوٌ</span> (K, TA)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنًا</span>; (JK, TA;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اخنى</span></b>  (JK, S, K)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْهِ فِى مَنْطِقِهِ</span>, (S, TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى كَلَامِهِ</span>, (JK,)
<i>He uttered foul, abominable, unseemly,</i> or <i>obscene,
speech</i> (JK, * S, K) <i>against him.</i> (S, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنَى</span>, (JK, K,) [aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخْنِى</span>,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنْىٌ</span>, (TA,)
<i>He cut,</i> or <i>severed,</i> the trunk of a palm-tree (JK,
K) with an axe; (JK;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَنَأَ</span>. (JK, TA.)

